BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<p>Last scheduled day of school for students**</p>\n<p>**The la
 st scheduled day of school is based on the adopted Board calendar and may 
 change due to inclement weather or other closures. Maryland law requires 1
 80 instructional days. School systems must identify six inclement weather 
 make-up days if a virtual instruction plan has not been approved. If addit
 ional days are needed\, the school year will be extended beyond the schedu
 led last day for students. If make-up days are not used\, the school year 
 may end earlier while still meeting required instructional days. If inclem
 ent weather days have to be made up\, the teacher work day will follow the
  last day for students.</p>
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270605
DTSTAMP:20260728T131713Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270604
LAST-MODIFIED:20260720T183409Z
LOCATION:
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Last scheduled day of school for students**
UID:75102722
END:VEVENT
