 tional days. School systems must identify six inclement weather make-up da
 ys if a virtual instruction plan has not been approved. If additional days
  are needed\, the school year will be extended beyond the scheduled last d
 ay for students. If make-up days are not used\, the school year may end ea
 rlier while still meeting required instructional days. If inclement weathe
 r days have to be made up\, the teacher work day will follow the last day 
 for students.</p>
